@DriveFleet.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7094


### Register a new client

POST {{DriveFleet.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Carla",
  "lastName": "Ferreira",
  "email": "carla@example.com",
  "phone": "934444444",
  "password": "Example134!"
}

###

### Invalid email

POST {{DriveFleet.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

